From 4babbe40d79633ce2d44a9dc6159805184ba7b41 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:33:25 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 24/24] kcm_regionandlang: Form page (Language, Formats, Paper
 and Contacts), pickers as pushed sub-pages
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: Form (docs/page-design.md section 1). It was a list of ten rows that each had a "Modify…" button; the rows
are now one Kirigami.FormLayout with label, current example and a "Change…" button. Settings (Formats/LC_*, LANG,
Translations/LANGUAGE, BinaryUnitDialect), locale generation, AccountsService call and reboot call are unchanged.

Moved / renamed:
- Main page: KCM.ScrollViewKCM + ListView -> KCM.SimpleKCM + FormLayout. Sections: untitled first (Language, the
  most common question), "Formats" (Numbers, Time, Currency, Measurements, Data and Storage Sizes), "Paper and
  Contacts" (Paper Size, Address, Name Style, Phone Numbers). Still driven by kcm.optionsModel, so hidden LC_ADDRESS
  rows stay hidden. Rows kcm_regionandlang/model-name, cfg-Formats-LANG.
- "Modify…" -> "Change…" ("Change Language…" for the language row; accessible name "Change <area>…")
  (kcm_regionandlang/depth). "Add More…" -> "Add Languages…" (Add-More). "Restart now" -> "Restart Now" (RestartNow).
- The three Loaders that held the sub-pages are gone: the language page, the locale picker (now LocalePickerPage.qml)
  and Data and Storage Sizes (BinaryDialectPage.qml) are pushed with kcm.push(file) when a button is clicked, so
  none of them exists before then. Page bodies moved verbatim (picker keeps its kcm.settings.* writes, search field,
  Default entry/kcm.unset, kcm.takeLast()). Defaults/Load/Save still pop every sub-page.
- Not done: Keyboard layouts and time zone stay on kcm_keyboard / kcm_clock (ia/duplicates.md).
- Relabel table: inventory/relabel/kcm_regionandlang.tsv (outer repo). Inventory --strict: 20 rows ok, 0 lost; full
  check LOST 0.

Speed: first frame waited on (a) OptionsModel constructor calling load() (a QLocale and formatted example per
area, optionsmodel.cpp load) and then KCMRegionAndLang::load() calling it again with the same config values; the
second call is skipped now (m_firstLoad); (b) previously the Loaders were created lazily already, so the big
LocaleListModel (QLocale::matchingLocales over all locales, localelistmodel.cpp ctor) still runs when a picker is
opened, not at start. GlibcLocaleConstructor (directory listing, availableDomainTranslations) is still built
in the KCM constructor; making it lazy was judged too invasive without a build. After-numbers: pending, manager
will measure.

HIG: HIG-001/005/006 (current state first), HIG-057, section titles as nouns. Not built yet. Unconfirmed API:
required property var model in an inline component used as a Repeater delegate (Qt 6 supports it); SimpleKCM
supports header/headerPaddingEnabled like ScrollViewKCM; kcm.push(file, props) with relative file names (same as
kcm_autostart); kcmutils_add_qml_kcm globs ui/* so the two new files are picked up.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
